*PREPCHEF*
*prepchef*

# Mobile experiments
frontend/android/
*.skill

# Generated test/QA artifacts (not source — qa/qa-health/latest.json IS tracked)
frontend/test-results/
.qa-health/

# launch_orchestrator run artifacts (#2958).
# README.md:90 documents `generated/` as gitignored; it was not, so a `git add -A`
# after a non-dry-run would have committed a credential file. The orchestrator no
# longer writes full API keys anywhere, but the run artifacts still do not belong
# in version control.
launch_orchestrator/generated/
launch_orchestrator/orchestration_result.json
